     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap NgVaccineLocal-to-SNOMED</b></p><a name=\"NgVaccineLocal-to-SNOMED\"> </a><a name=\"hcNgVaccineLocal-to-SNOMED\"> </a><p>Mapping from <a href=\"ValueSet-ng-vaccine-local-vs.html\">NG Vaccine Local ValueSet</a> to <a href=\"ValueSet-ng-vaccine-snomed-vs.html\">NG Vaccine SNOMED ValueSet</a></p><br/><p>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-vaccine-local.html\">NG IMMZ.D.DE4 Vaccine Local Codes (Dose-labelled)</a> to <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-vaccine-local-to-snomed-cs.html\">NG IMMZ.D.DE4 Vaccine Library (SNOMED CT)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>IMMZ.Z.DE2 (HepB birth dose)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>871822003 (Hepatitis B vaccine)</td></tr><tr><td>IMMZ.Z.DE3 (Polio (OPV0) birth dose)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>293117006 (Poliomyelitis vaccine)</td></tr><tr><td>IMMZ.Z.DE5 (Oral Polio Vaccine (OPV 1))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>293117006 (Poliomyelitis vaccine)</td></tr><tr><td>IMMZ.Z.DE9 (Oral Polio Vaccine (OPV 2))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>293117006 (Poliomyelitis vaccine)</td></tr><tr><td>IMMZ.Z.DE13 (Oral Polio Vaccine (OPV 3))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>293117006 (Poliomyelitis vaccine)</td></tr><tr><td>IMMZ.Z.DE8 (Inactivated Polio Vaccine (IPV 1))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>293117006 (Poliomyelitis vaccine)</td></tr><tr><td>IMMZ.Z.DE17 (Inactivated Polio Vaccine (IPV 2))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>293117006 (Poliomyelitis vaccine)</td></tr><tr><td>IMMZ.Z.DE4 (Pentavalent 1)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>409568008 (DTP-HepB-Hib vaccine)</td></tr><tr><td>IMMZ.Z.DE11 (Pentavalent 2)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>409568008 (DTP-HepB-Hib vaccine)</td></tr><tr><td>IMMZ.Z.DE14 (Pentavalent 3)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>409568008 (DTP-HepB-Hib vaccine)</td></tr><tr><td>IMMZ.Z.DE6 (Pneumococcal Conjugate Vaccine (PCV 1))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>1052328007 (Pneumococcal conjugate vaccine)</td></tr><tr><td>IMMZ.Z.DE10 (Pneumococcal Conjugate Vaccine (PCV 2))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>1052328007 (Pneumococcal conjugate vaccine)</td></tr><tr><td>IMMZ.Z.DE15 (Pneumococcal Conjugate Vaccine (PCV 3))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concep